n. Permit for Procurement of Cosmetics (PPK);
o. Permit for Procurement of Household Health Supplies (PPKRT);
p. Permit for Procurement of Traditional Medicines (PPPOT);
q. Permit for Procurement of Food Supplements (PPMS);
r. Permit for Procurement of Hazardous Materials (PPBB);
s. Health Service Permit;
t. Permit for Procurement of Medical Devices and Household Health Supplies (PPAMKRT);
